---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy · Cakeopedia Austin" description="How Cakeopedia Austin handles the contact details, notes and pictures you send in an enquiry, and keeps them private.">
  <div class="wrap page-head prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Your details</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:var(--space-3)">Draft for owner review.</p>
    <p>When you send an enquiry, Cakeopedia receives the details you type so the baker can reply. They are used to answer your enquiry and manage your order, and are not sold or used in advertising.</p>
    <p>Pictures you share for inspiration are kept private and are not shown on this website.</p>
    <p>How long enquiries are kept, and how to ask for yours to be deleted, will be confirmed here before enquiries open.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
